        "created_at": "2021-03-23T14:23:03.008Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Christopher and Paul once again as Adam was unavailable</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/publishers-note-10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2195fb0b2700b1df502aa120a68af896730a6609.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/publishers-note-10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Publishers' Note #10</a></h3>\n\n<p>Paul is back! Back again! Paul is back, Paul is back, Paul is back! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:18:51 We talk a lot about stabs. We're into stabs here. Upcoming schedule!  Tuesday, April 6th: Episode #172: Writers’ Room: A Day in the Life — Absolute Zero...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming Episodes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, April 6th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#172:</span> Writers’ Room: A Day in the Life — Absolute Zero</li>\n<li>Tuesday, April 13th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#173:</span> Writers’ Room: Disparation — Citizen Storm vs. The Primal Wardens</li>\n<li>Tuesday, April 20th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#45</span> (?!?!)</li>\n<li>Tuesday, April 27th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#174:</span> Classic Episode: xxtz’Hulissh</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Recording schedule</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Friday, April 2nd: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#172:</span> Writers’ Room: A Day in the Life — Absolute Zero</li>\n<li>Friday, April 9th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#173:</span> Writers’ Room: Disparation — Citizen Storm vs. The Primal Wardens</li>\n<li>Friday, April 16th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#45</span> (?!?!)</li>\n<li>Friday, April 23rd: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#174:</span> Classic Episode: xxtz’Hulissh</li>\n</ul>",
