        "raw": "Christopher and Paul once again as Adam was unavailable\nhttps://theletterspage.libsyn.com/publishers-note-10\n\nUpcoming Episodes:\n\n* Tuesday, April 6th: Episode #172: Writers’ Room: A Day in the Life — Absolute Zero\n* Tuesday, April 13th: Episode #173: Writers’ Room: Disparation — Citizen Storm vs. The Primal Wardens\n* Tuesday, April 20th: Editor’s Note #45 (?!?!)\n* Tuesday, April 27th: Episode #174: Classic Episode: xxtz’Hulissh\n\nRecording schedule\n\n* Friday, April 2nd: Episode #172: Writers’ Room: A Day in the Life — Absolute Zero\n* Friday, April 9th: Episode #173: Writers’ Room: Disparation — Citizen Storm vs. The Primal Wardens\n* Friday, April 16th: Editor’s Note #45 (?!?!)\n* Friday, April 23rd: Episode #174: Classic Episode: xxtz’Hulissh",
