      {
        "id": 236294,
        "name": "WalkingTarget",
        "username": "WalkingTarget",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/walkingtarget/{size}/4833_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-03-23T16:39:45.193Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"28316\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Okay, but a one-off comment by Christopher begs a question I’ve been pondering lately: Is Nightmist named after Adam’s sister, as Argent Adept was named after Christopher’s brother?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>From the first live Gen Con episode:</p>\n<p>Who’s named for real people? Anthony Drake for Christopher’s brother. <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Legacy\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Paul Parsons</a> for Adam’s brother. <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Omnitron\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Aldred Industries</a> is tied to Paul Bender’s family and <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Wraith\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Maia Montgomery</a> for his wife. <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Setback\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Pete Riske</a>, <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Eaken-Rubendaal_Laboratories\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Eaken-Rubendaal Laboratories</a>, <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=President_Hargett&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">President Hargett</a>, <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Grand_Warlord_Voss\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Grand Warlord Voss</a>, and <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Bunker\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Tyler Vance</a> are named for friends. <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Visionary\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Vanessa Long</a> is named for Adam’s wife. In general, there’s no connection between the real person and the in-game person or entity (Anthony’s <em>music</em> and Pete being exceptions). There are more examples that are being withheld for privacy reasons.</p>\n<p>Edit - Shoot, I got interrupted as I was going through the process of looking this up and copy/pasting it and so forgot to actually check if Faye was even mentioned. <em>facepalm</em></p>",
